{"id":280,"gn":"Pokémon Sentiment","ft":["Quand ses cornes captent les ondes positives d’un Pokémon ou d’un humain, son corps se réchauffe.","Il est très sensible aux émotions des gens et des Pokémon. Il se cache au moindre signe d’hostilité.","Tarsal ressent les émotions des gens grâce à ses cornes. Ce Pokémon se montre rarement, mais il arrive qu’il s’approche d’une personne s’il la sent dans un état d’esprit positif.","Tarsal a le pouvoir de ressentir les émotions des gens. Si son Dresseur est d’humeur joyeuse, ce Pokémon devient lui aussi gai et enjoué.","Quand ses cornes rouges captent les ondes positives d’un Pokémon ou d’un humain, tout son corps se réchauffe."],"fv":{"17":0,"18":0,"23":0,"24":1,"25":2,"26":3,"33":1,"34":4},"gr":4,"cr":235,"hc":20,"bh":35,"eg":["Humanoïde","Amorphe"],"gw":"slow","gm":{"za":[0,87],"svmask":[0,57],"sv":[0,62,1,57],"la":[0,101],"swisle":[0,34],"sw":[0,120,1,34],"oras":[0,29],"xy":[0,64],"pt":[0,157],"e":[0,29],"rs":[0,29]},"f":{"280":{"n":"Tarsal","t":["psychic","fairy"],"s":[28,25,25,45,35,40],"h":0.4,"w":6.6,"a":[[28,0],[36,0],[140,1]],"pt":[[5,["psychic"]]],"pa":[[4,[[28,0],[36,0]]]],"av":["za","svmask","sv","la","swisle","sw","oras","xy","pt","e","rs"],"hi":[[225,100,[20]]],"ls":[{"l":[[45,1],[574,1],[104,3],[93,6],[95,9],[577,12],[100,15],[60,18],[791,21],[204,24],[347,27],[94,30],[505,33],[138,36],[248,39]],"m":[7,8,9,34,60,85,86,94,109,113,115,118,129,156,164,168,182,196,203,204,214,220,227,240,241,244,247,248,261,263,269,270,271,282,285,286,304,345,347,374,428,433,447,451,473,500,574,577,581,605,678,797,851,914],"e":[50,109,194,212,262,282,425,595]},{"l":[[93,1],[100,6],[577,11],[95,18],[347,25],[94,34]]},{"l":[[45,1],[574,1],[104,3],[93,6],[95,9],[577,12],[100,15],[60,18],[791,21],[204,24],[347,27],[94,30],[505,33],[138,36],[248,39]],"m":[5,7,8,9,25,34,85,86,94,113,115,129,156,164,168,173,182,196,203,204,213,214,219,227,240,241,247,248,261,263,269,270,271,285,286,304,345,347,374,428,433,447,472,473,478,496,500,502,577,5